notes:
•  FIX attempts for sound going silent:
     - live sound now always starts within 1.5 seconds, even if the camera sends less sound than expected (before, it could wait forever for its buffer to fill);
     - switching between tiles can no longer leave a hidden extra sound connection to a camera running;
     - turning sound back on (toolbar speaker / Ctrl+M) reconnects the Windows sound output, so it follows headphones or speakers plugged in after MxScout started.
•  NEW: Help > Sound Check (also under Playback). Shows live where the sound stops - no sound device, muted, no tile selected, camera not sending sound, or sound arriving - with a Play Test Beep button and Reconnect Sound Device.
